ct City Ad XUV 3XO Price Compare Images Specs User Reviews 360 View Variants Videos More Mileage Colours XUV 3XO News FAQs Dealers Service Center Brochure XUV 3XO EMI Loan Second Hand XUV 3XO Mahindra XUV 3XO Specifications The Mahindra XUV 3XO has 1 Diesel Engine and 1 Petrol Engine on offer. The Diesel engine is 1498 cc while the Petrol engine is 1197 cc . It is available with Manual & Automatic transmission.Depending upon the variant and fuel type the XUV 3XO has a mileage of 17.96 to 20.6 kmpl. The XUV 3XO is a 5 seater 3 cylinder car and has length of 3990 mm, width of 1821 mm and a wheelbase of 2600. Read More 4.6 302 Reviews Shortlist Rs. 7.99 - 15.80 Lakh * EMI starts @ 21,646 View July Offers Ad Standout features of Mahindra XUV 3XO Soft touch material on dashboard and door pads. Panoramic sunroof - largest in the segment. Level 2 ADAS with features such as forward collision warning, adaptive cruise control. 1.2-litre turbo-petrol engine makes 130PS/230Nm most powerful in its class. Key specifications of Mahindra XUV 3XO ARAI Mileage 18.2 kmpl Fuel Type Petrol Engine Displacement 1197 cc No. of Cylinders 3 Max Power 128.73bhp@5000rpm Max Torque 230Nm@1500-3750rpm Seating Capacity 5 Transmission Type Automatic Boot Space 364 Litres Fuel Tank Capacity 42 Litres Body Type SUV Key features of Mahindra XUV 3XO Power Steering Yes Power Windows Front Yes Anti-lock Braking System (ABS) Yes Air Conditioner Yes Driver Airbag Yes Passenger Airbag Yes Automatic Climate Control Yes Alloy Wheels Yes Multi-function Steering Wheel Yes Mahindra XUV 3XO specifications Engine & Transmission Engine Type mStallion (TGDi) engine Displacement 1197 cc Max Power 128.73bhp@5000rpm Max Torque 230Nm@1500-3750rpm No. of Cylinders 3 Valves Per Cylinder 4 Turbo Charger Yes Transmission Type Automatic Gearbox 6-Speed AT Drive Type FWD Report Incorrect Specs Don\'t miss out on the best offers for this Month View July Offers Fuel & Performance Fuel Type Petrol Petrol Mileage ARAI 18.2 kmpl Petrol Fuel Tank Capacity 42 Litres Emission Norm Compliance BS VI 2.0 Report Incorrect Specs Suspension, Steering & Brakes Front Suspension MacPherson Strut suspension Rear Suspension Rear twist beam Steering Type Electric Turning Radius 5.3 m Front Brake Type Disc Rear Brake Type Disc Alloy Wheel Size Front 17 Inch Alloy Wheel Size Rear 17 Inch Report Incorrect Specs Don\'t miss out on the best offers for this Month View July Offers Dimensions & Capacity Length 3990 mm Width 1821 mm Height 1647 mm Boot Space 364 Litres Seating Capacity 5 Wheel Base 2600 mm No. of Doors 5 Report Incorrect Specs Don\'t miss out on the best offers for this Month View July Offers Comfort & Convenience Power Steering Air Conditioner Heater Height Adjustable Driver Seat Ventilated Seats Electric Adjustable Seats Automatic Climate Control Accessory Power Outlet Rear Reading Lamp Adjustable Headrest Rear Seat Centre Arm Rest Height Adjustable Front Seat Belts Rear AC Vents Cruise Control Parking Sensors Front & Rear Real-Time Vehicle Tracking Foldabl", \'images\': [], \'rank\': 4}, {\'url\': \'https://www.carversal.com/blogs/mahindra-xuv-3xo-onroad-price-features--specs--full-details/520\', \'content\': "Mahindra XUV 3XO On-Road Price, Features & Specs | Full Details CARVERSAL Home About Us Contact Us Privacy Policy More Login Term and Conditions Disclosure Home About Us Privacy Policy Contact Us More Login Term and Conditions Disclosure Mahindra XUV 3XO On-Road Price, Features & Specs | Full Details March 12th, 2025 Mahindra XUV 3XO is the latest compact SUV from Mahindra that is trying to make its presence felt strongly in the Indian market. With a price of between 7.49 lakh (ex-showroom) for the lowest variant and 15.49 lakh for the highest variant, the XUV 3XO has sufficient variants to provide to the buyers. It comes in nine trims and 25 variants in total, so there is something for everyone. Let us look more at the Mahindra XUV 3XO\'s On Road price and features. Mahindra XUV 3XO Price At 7.99 lakh, the Mahindra XUV 3XO begins its price range from its base model. The fully stocked top model of the Mahindra XUV 3XO comes with a price tag reaching up to 15.57 lakh on average. Different buyers can find value in the Mahindra XUV 3XO due to its pricing arrangement, which spans between 7.99 lakh and 15.57 lakh. Read More: GAME CHANGER: All-New 2025 Mahindra Scorpio with Next-Gen Safety and with BIGGER, BETTER, BOLDER Design! Design Mahindra XUV 3XO has been totally overhauled from its previous model, the XUV300. It now features: Redesigned LED projector headlamps for improved visibility. New LED DRLs will give it a fashionable appearance. A new two-splitted grille and front bumper for a tough appearance. C-shaped LED rear tail lights and full-width LED light bar towards the rear give it a sporty and upscale look in its rear profile. These features give the XUV 3XO a premium and stylish appearance, which is aimed at young customers as well as family buyers. Engine and Performance Three engines come along with the XUV 3XO: 1.2-litre Turbo-Petrol Engine: The engine offers power and torque of 110 bhp and 200 Nm, respectively, and thus delivers a good performance with good fuel efficiency. 1.2-litre Direct Injection Turbo-Petrol Engine: More powerful turbo-petrol motor with 130 bhp power and 230 Nm of torque, perfect for the sportsman driver. 1.5-litre Turbo-Diesel Engine: With 115 bhp and an incredible 300 Nm of torque, this diesel engine is perfect for highway cruising and heavy loads. All the engines are designed to provide a smooth and responsive drive on city streets and highways, too. Features Mahindra XUV 3XO is packed with features that make it the segment leader. Some of the most outstanding of these features are: A 10.25-inch touchscreen infotainment with a natural interface. A 10.25-inch digital instrument cluster with simple access to the majority of driving data. Dual-zone automatic climate control to provide driver and passengers comfort. A panoramic sunroof for a light and fresh interior. A seven-speaker Harman Kardon premium audio system for a luxury listening experience. Wireless Android Auto and Apple CarPlay for easy smartphone integration. All these facets make the XUV 3XO not just a car but a technological marvel as your daily travel companion. Safety Features Safety functions are not among Mahindra\'s priorities because the XUV 3XO omits all safety standards from its package. It comes with: Level 2 Advanced Driver Assistance Systems (ADAS): The XUV 3XO includes Level 2 Advanced Driver Assistance Systems which deliver adaptive cruise control together with lane-keep assist for safer driving operations. 360-degree cameras: The car system shows a complete external panorama that helps during driving operations as well as parking sessions. Six airbags standard: Maximum safety for all on board. Disc brakes, hill descent control, and hill hold control: The system enhances user control thanks to its components, including disc brakes and hill descent control combined with hill hold control, particularly in harsh terrain situations. Traction control: Provides traction on uneven or slippery road surfaces. All safety features", \'images\': [], \'rank\': 5}, {\'url\': \'https://www.carbike360.com/cars/mahindra/xuv-3xo\', \'content\': \'[not extracted] Content limit reached\', \'rank\': 6}, {\'url\': \'https://automotivemahindra.com/mahindra-xuv-3xo-an-in-depth-specification-breakdown/\', \'content\': \'[not extracted] Content limit reached\', \'rank\': 7}, {\'url\': \'https://cargraze.com/blog/2025-mahindra-xuv-3xo-specs-design-performance-and-safety\', \'content\': \'[not extracted] Content limit reached\', \'rank\': 8}]', 'annotations': None}]
