 and a passive keyless entry. It also features a front armrest with storage and a console with a cup holder for a comfortable drive. Check out: Mahindra XUV 3XO Interior 3. Smart Connectivity Another key Mahindra XUV 3XO configuration is its smart connectivity and technology. The car comes with a Harman Kardon 7-speaker audio system to make your drive enjoyable. In addition, the sound system lets you experience sonic expanse, and the bass enhancer technology uplifts your mood while driving in crowded areas. The Mahindra XUV 3XO features a high-definition touchscreen system for infotainment and navigation and has built-in Amazon Alexa for entertainment. Moreover, with the ADRENOX Connect technology, you can control your cars features through y', 'images': [], 'rank': 3}, {'url': 'https://www.cardekho.com/mahindra/xuv-3xo/specs', 'content': \"Mahindra XUV 3XO Specifications - Dimensions, Configurations, Features, Engine cc All New Used English Login / Register NEW CARS Explore New Cars Electric Cars Tata Harrier EV Mahindra XEV 9e Mahindra BE 6 MG Windsor EV MG Comet EV Tata Nexon EV All Electric Cars Popular Cars Defender Mahindra XUV 3XO Hyundai Creta Mahindra Scorpio Mahindra Thar ROXX Mahindra XUV700 All Popular Cars Upcoming Cars New Launches Car Insurance Ad Popular Brands Maruti Cars Tata Cars Kia Cars Toyota Cars Hyundai Cars Mahindra Cars Compare Cars New Car Offers & Discounts Find Car Dealers Find EV Charging Stations Find Fuel Stations Check Fuel Prices Used cars Buy Used Cars Used Cars In Your City Ahmedabad Bangalore Chennai Delhi NCR Hyderabad Jaipur Kolkata Mumbai Pune More Cities Sell My Car Used Car Valuation Dealership Near Me News & Reviews News & Top stories Car Expert Reviews User Reviews Car Collection Tips & Advice Videos Video Reviews Visual Stories Select City Ad XUV 3XO Price Compare Images Specs User Reviews 360 View Variants Videos More Mileage Colours XUV 3XO News FAQs Dealers Service Center Brochure XUV 3XO EMI Loan Second Hand XUV 3XO M